        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    units_sold = 50000\n    purchase_costs = [\n        (40000, 17),  # 1/23 purchase\n        (30000, 15),  # 1/20 purchase\n        (20000, 13),  # Beginning inventory\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer using LIFO\n    units_remaining = units_sold\n    cost_of_goods_sold = 0\n\n    for units, cost_per_unit in purchase_costs:\n        units_used = min(units_remaining, units)\n        cost_of_goods_sold += units_used * cost_per_unit\n        units_remaining -= units_used\n\n        if units_remaining == 0:\n            break\n\n    # Return answer to the nearest dollar\n    return round(cost_of_goods_sold)\n```",
